{"id":"7691d5ec76419b08","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-one-predicate-qml.md","title":"One Unary Predicate with No Nested Boxes","display":"df-one-predicate-qml — One Unary Predicate with No Nested Boxes","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-one-predicate-qml","aliases":["89-df-one-predicate-qml"],"display":"df-one-predicate-qml — One Unary Predicate with No Nested Boxes","depends_on":["[[89-df-qml-formula]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-one-predicate-qml"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-one-predicate-qml</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-one-predicate-qml — One Unary Predicate with No Nested Boxes"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"15c083801acd41a1\" href=\"?note=15c083801acd41a1\" title=\"89-df-qml-formula\">89-df-qml-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 是固定一元谓词字母；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pred}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Pred}(A)\\)</span> 为公式树中的谓词字母集。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>盒深度递归：原子及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span> 深度 0；否定与量词保持深度；合取取最大；盒加 1。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{depth}_{\\Box}:\\mathrm{Fml}_Q\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathrm{depth}_{\\Box}:\\mathrm{Fml}_Q\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 采用上述递归的盒深度，不计算量词深度。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}one\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}qml}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{G,1}\\coloneqq\n\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_Q\\mid\n\\mathrm{Pred}(A)\\subseteq\\{G\\}\\land\\mathrm{depth}_{\\Box}(A)\\le1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}one\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}qml}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{G,1}\\coloneqq\n\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_Q\\mid\n\\mathrm{Pred}(A)\\subseteq\\{G\\}\\land\\mathrm{depth}_{\\Box}(A)\\le1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 18 章，印刷页 242–255；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n“无嵌套盒”限制盒深度，不禁止量词深度，也不限制变量只有一个。允许量词作用于盒公式以及在盒内部出现量词；但任何盒的作用域中不得再含盒。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-qml-formula","status":"resolved","id":"15c083801acd41a1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-qml-formula]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Pred}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{depth}_{\\Box}:\\mathrm{Fml}_Q\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}one\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}qml}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{G,1}\\coloneqq\n\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_Q\\mid\n\\mathrm{Pred}(A)\\subseteq\\{G\\}\\land\\mathrm{depth}_{\\Box}(A)\\le1\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1271,"backlinks":[{"id":"73653f2b36e4ca9d","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-76","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-one-predicate-qml]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-189","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-one-predicate-qml]] → [[89-thm-one-predicate-complexity]]"}],"outgoing":["15c083801acd41a1"]}